"""
cogs/2egg_status.py  -  live "Available Eggs" boards (multi-server)

How it works
  APP --(webhook)--> private #egg-feed channel (SERVER 1) --(bot reads it)--> edits the 14 board
  messages in EVERY server where an admin ran !eggdisplay.

  The feed is global. Only ONE channel (in your main server) is the feed. Every other server
  just runs !eggdisplay and gets the same live boards, Last Seen times, alerts and rare pings.

Boards (each is its own message; every biome has its own board)
  1 Forest        4 Jungle       7 Abyss Ocean       10 Cherry Blossom    13 Enchanted Forest
  2 Lake          5 Snow         8 Prehistoric       11 Titan Temple      14 Dr Scramble (always last)
  3 Desert        6 Volcano      9 Cosmic            12 Angels / Demons

Every board shows a live "Next update" countdown. The APP sends how old the current
egg cycle is (the "_age" value), and the bot adds REROLL_INTERVAL to get the next reroll time.

The Dr Scramble board shows (Biohazard / Experimental / Unstable DNA). The APP sends
"_scramble" (banner name). The bot starts its own SCRAMBLE_INTERVAL (1 hour) countdown
whenever the banner name changes. "_scramble_left" from the APP is ignored.

Board images: edit the BANNERS dict below. Each board has its own line.

Commands (bot owner only, SERVER 1)
  !eggfeed          run in the private feed channel -> bot reads egg data from here
                    (!egginput still works as an alias)

Commands (administrator, any server)
  !eggdisplay       run in the public board channel -> bot posts the boards and edits them from now on
  !eggcheck         shows eggs with no emoji + names the game sent that the catalog doesn't know

  Rare egg notifications (each server sets up its own). Same for secret / eternal / divine:
  !secret #channel          send Secret egg notifications in that channel (mention, link or ID)
  !secret ping @role        ping that role when a Secret egg spawns
  !secret                   show the current settings
  !secret off               stop using the channel (falls back to the board channel if a role is set)
  !secret ping off          remove the role ping

Commands (everyone)
  !alert <egg>   ping me when the egg is available
  !value <egg>   value of a Secret / Eternal / Divine egg
  !mutate        interactive Money/s calculator (button + pop-up + dropdown)
  !ls            last seen times for Divine / Eternal / Secret eggs
"""
