# Each mutation: (multiplier, emoji, embed colour)
# Bonuses are ADDED and each one is based on the ORIGINAL Money/s
# (confirmed in the game's calculator: 12M with Silver + Golden
#  = 12M x (1 + 0.2 + 1.5) = 32.4M)
